-- LUNA_UI_SCHEMA_V1
-- Luna UI, design 05 (rework): dark charcoal control panel with a champagne accent.
-- Native Roblox controls only; no gameplay logic and no remote loader.
-- API (unchanged): CreateWindow -> Tab -> Section / Toggle / Slider / Dropdown / Input / Button / Label.
-- Set(value, true) updates a control silently. Mounting never calls feature callbacks.
-- Mount reads GetUIDescriptor()/GetUIData(): tabs, sections, parameters, labels,
-- buttons and mapped dropdown commands. Parameters supply types/ranges/options.
-- SchemaVersion changes only for an incompatible protocol, never for a farm update.
--
-- Optional descriptor fields understood by this renderer (all ignored when absent):
--   Window.StatusSource   data key shown as the live status line in the window footer
--   Window.StatusToneSource  data key holding "ok" | "warn" | "error" for that line
--   Window.ToggleKey      Enum.KeyCode that shows/hides the menu (default K)
--   Item Label: Tone = "ok" | "warn" | "error"   coloured marker beside a status label
--   Item Button: Primary = true                   filled main action
--   Item Dropdown: Placeholder = "..."            text shown while nothing is selected
